<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria forex reserves rise by $100 mln in March.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria forex reserves rise by $100 mln in March.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank (BNB) foreign exchange reserves rose by $100 million in March from $445.5 million in February, Finance Minister Svetoslav Gavriiski said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
